    "source_notes": "Reference for this template's layout and text came from screenshots the Forza Writer user supplied directly (in-game/in-editor captures), not from any file, image, or asset extracted or downloaded from the game itself or an official tool. Two Saints Row: The Third vehicles' plates both read 'SR3' followed by four digits (e.g. 'SR3 5221', 'SR3 9686') -- that prefix/format is a direct transcription from the supplied screenshots. Each screenshot also shows a small script-style sticker or stripe near the plate that a Saints Row wiki page describes as reading 'Steelport' -- included here as a low-confidence best guess (field 'steelport_tag' below), since the actual text is too small to read with confidence in either screenshot; treat its wording and exact styling as unverified. No background color, border, or plate-face font is documented anywhere for this design (a genuine research gap, not an oversight), so the background/border here are a plain, undecorated approximation rather than anything sourced.",
